# Board tags (Pavilion workspace)

When creating HSKRG Work tickets from this repo:

| Work | Labels |
|------|--------|
| Shared product / demo / trial CRM | `product` |
| SHMS promote / school-only | `customer:shms` |
| Lumi | `customer:lumi` |

Org: `pavilion` (unless cross-product → `hskrg`).

Wiki Why must state `Audience: product` or `Audience: customer:…`.

## Feature ship ladder

1. Pavilion (commons-pto-demo) — fully built + browser/e2e  
2. Customer staging — re-QA  
3. Customer prod  

Do not open customer promote while a product feature is mid-build unless Rob asks.

Full map: `docs/PRODUCT-VS-CUSTOMER.md` and `~/shmspto/docs/AGENT-SHIP-MAP.md`.
